<title>UK: Tatneft ADS quoted at $47.00/49.00.</title>
<headline>Tatneft ADS quoted at $47.00/49.00.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Depositary Shares in AO Tatneft, an oil company from the Russian republic of Tatarstan were quoted at $47.00/$49.00 on London's SEAQ International by 1100 GMT.</p>
<p>The company said earlier today that it had priced 2.326 million ADS at $45.00.</p>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson was global coordinator, lead manager and bookrunner for the ADS offering. -- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
